"""DNSpreload v2: mobile-first web panel and metrics exporter.

The panel reads state, lists, unbound statistics and read-only Pi-hole databases.
Metrics use InfluxDB line protocol for Telegraf/Grafana, on a five-minute timer.
Restrict access to admin networks with the panel firewall rules.
Each row answers one question with a short, unwrapped value and status dot.
Each section ends with one next step or a no-action message.
"""
